WEBVTT

00:01:58.081 --> 00:02:03.370
Counting the rings of a single trunk will
only account for up to 200 years or so,

00:02:03.370 --> 00:02:09.008
as Pando is in a constant cycle of growth,
death, and renewal.

00:02:09.008 --> 00:02:13.286
On average, each individual tree 
lives 130 years,

00:02:13.286 --> 00:02:17.471
before falling and being
replaced by new ones.

00:02:17.471 --> 00:02:19.441
Second: location.

00:02:19.441 --> 00:02:23.774
During the last ice age, 
which ended about 12,000 years ago,

00:02:23.774 --> 00:02:26.699
glaciers covered much 
of the North American climate

00:02:26.699 --> 00:02:28.319
friendly to aspens.

00:02:28.319 --> 00:02:32.444
